// Hit: a noise burst over a triangle thud that drops in pitch.
// Composed in MML for the TerraForma example game; rendered with chipsynth (python -m chipsynth sfx).
title Hit
author Claude, at Michael Allen Wilmes's request
tempo 240
once

[instr]
burst wave=noise nmode=long a=0 d=6 s=0 r=3 vol=15
thud  wave=tri a=0 d=5 s=0 r=3 vol=15

V1: @burst o4 g16 r32
V2: @thud o3 g32 slide 8 2c16
